Grammar

    0 $accept: prog $end

    1 prog: exp

    2 let: LET decs IN expseq END

    3 decs: dec decs
    4     | error decs
    5     | ε

    6 dec: tydec
    7    | vardec
    8    | fundec

    9 tydec: TYPE ID EQ ty

   10 ty: ID
   11   | LBRACE tyfields RBRACE
   12   | ARRAY OF ID

   13 tyfields: ID COLON ID
   14         | ID COLON ID COMMA tyfields
   15         | ε

   16 vardec: VAR ID ASSIGN exp
   17       | VAR ID COLON ID ASSIGN exp

   18 arrdec: ID LBRACK exp RBRACK OF exp
   19       | ID NIL

   20 fundec: FUNCTION ID LPAREN tyfields RPAREN EQ exp
   21       | FUNCTION ID LPAREN tyfields RPAREN COLON ID EQ exp

   22 lvalue: ID
   23       | lvalue DOT ID
   24       | lvalue LBRACK exp RBRACK
   25       | ID LBRACK exp RBRACK

   26 fparams: exp COMMA fparams
   27        | exp
   28        | ε

   29 valess: ID LPAREN fparams RPAREN
   30       | lvalue ASSIGN exp
   31       | IF exp THEN exp ELSE exp
   32       | IF exp THEN exp
   33       | WHILE exp DO exp
   34       | FOR ID ASSIGN exp TO exp DO exp
   35       | BREAK

   36 recpara: ID EQ exp
   37        | ID EQ exp COMMA recpara
   38        | ε

   39 rec: ID LBRACE recpara RBRACE

   40 expseq: exp
   41       | expseq SEMICOLON exp
   42       | error SEMICOLON exp
   43       | ε

   44 exp: exp OR exp
   45    | exp AND exp
   46    | exp EQ exp
   47    | exp NEQ exp
   48    | exp LT exp
